[NEW] &lt;p&gt;When you enable the Enable Project Revenue recognition using the cost estimate instead of the EAC (estimate at complete) setting, you activate this feature.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses the original project estimate for PoC calculations: Delivers stable, predictable revenue without EAC-driven fluctuations.&lt; (GA: April CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Project Operations

&lt;p&gt;Real-time streaming analytics is built into the new supervisor application. An advanced streaming engine keeps metrics up to date with near-instant updates, allowing supervisors to view the latest data without refreshing the dashboard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key capabilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continu (GA: October CY2026) — Dynamics 365 Contact Center
